{"unit_id":"hanyi7867069-create__dsh-content-lab#readme-1","repo":"hanyi7867069-create/dsh-content-lab","commit":"cd6181b005dd7cafd13d1bedf08b54901e145d5b","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-content-lab README · dsh-content-lab · 内容工坊：给 DeepSeek Harness 装上\"内容生产流水线\"：选题 → 标题 → 文案 → 排期。\n\n面向做自媒体 / AI 副业 / 内容营销的人。全部工具在插件内直接调用 LLM，不依赖任何外部 API。","source":"extracted","section":"dsh-content-lab · 内容工坊"}
{"unit_id":"hanyi7867069-create__dsh-content-lab#readme-2","repo":"hanyi7867069-create/dsh-content-lab","commit":"cd6181b005dd7cafd13d1bedf08b54901e145d5b","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-content-lab README · Tools：| 工具 | 作用 |\n| --- | --- |\n| `content_topic_generator` | 按领域 × 平台生成爆款选题（含切入角度、钩子、理由） |\n| `content_title_rewriter` | 标题改写，支持悬念/数字/情绪/反差/疑问风格 |\n| `content_post_writer` | 按平台生成完整文案（小红书/公众号/抖音/B站） |\n| `content_calendar` | 生成 N 天内容排期表 |","source":"extracted","section":"Tools"}
{"unit_id":"hanyi7867069-create__dsh-content-lab#readme-3","repo":"hanyi7867069-create/dsh-content-lab","commit":"cd6181b005dd7cafd13d1bedf08b54901e145d5b","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"dsh-content-lab README · Install：```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-content-lab\n```","source":"extracted","section":"Install"}
{"unit_id":"hanyi7867069-create__dsh-content-lab#readme-4","repo":"hanyi7867069-create/dsh-content-lab","commit":"cd6181b005dd7cafd13d1bedf08b54901e145d5b","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-content-lab README · Configure：默认使用 `deepseek-official` provider 和 `deepseek-v4-flash` 模型。在 profile 的\n`cordis.patch.yml` 里按 `id: content-lab` 覆盖：\n\n```yaml\n- id: content-lab\n  name: dsh-content-lab\n  config:\n    provider: deepseek-official\n\n每个工具还接受可选的 `model` 参数做单次覆盖。","source":"extracted","section":"Configure"}
{"unit_id":"hanyi7867069-create__dsh-content-lab#readme-5","repo":"hanyi7867069-create/dsh-content-lab","commit":"cd6181b005dd7cafd13d1bedf08b54901e145d5b","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-content-lab README · Design：- **零外部依赖**：工具用原生 JSON-Schema 注册（`ctx.tools.register`），LLM 调用用\n  `ctx.llm.stream()` + 手建消息，不需要解析任何 `@deepseek-ai/*` 包。\n- 输出走\"结构化 JSON 规范值 + 可读渲染\"，模型只负责生成，工具负责保证格式。\n- 模型偶尔会吐脏 JSON，`parseJsonLoose` 会做宽松解析，失败时原样返回文本。","source":"extracted","section":"Design"}
{"unit_id":"hanyi7867069-create__dsh-content-lab#readme-6","repo":"hanyi7867069-create/dsh-content-lab","commit":"cd6181b005dd7cafd13d1bedf08b54901e145d5b","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-content-lab README · Roadmap：- v1：配图提示词生成 + AI 配图（接图像 API）\n- v2：模板包（小红书美妆号 / 电商带货 / 知识付费等垂类模板）\n- v3：定时批量出稿（配合 DSH schedule 能力）","source":"extracted","section":"Roadmap"}
